cff-version: 1.2.0
message: "If you use this software, please cite it as below."
title: "Stata2R"
abstract: >-
  A Claude plugin to aid translation of Stata packages to other software
  languages, primarily R and Python. The aim is to increase the impact of
  well written and tested Stata packages by translating them to more widely
  used programming languages.
